title: 'network/light: Process call requests in parallel, queue QoS'
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    Add a thread pool for processing light client execution proof requests and extract them into a
    dedicated queue. The number of workers is set to half the available CPU cores (at most 4) by
    default and can be increased via `--light-request-call-workers` cli.
crates:
- name: sc-network
  bump: major
- name: sc-network-light
  bump: major
- name: sc-cli
  bump: major
- name: sc-service
  bump: patch
